{"title": "Covert Critical", "pageid": 28363, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Covert_Critical", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Covert Critical</b> is a passive feature that makes the wearer more likely to critical hit while in shadow.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a>, the number you need to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by 1. This effect can stack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Covert_Critical\"> Condition: Covert Critical </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Critical_(Condition)\" title=\"Covert Critical (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Covert Critical\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Generic_Ethereal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Critical_(Condition)\" title=\"Covert Critical (Condition)\">Covert Critical</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>As long as the affected entity remains obscured, the number it needs to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a> a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by 1. This effect can stack.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Cowl\" title=\"Covert Cowl\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Frayed_Drow_Hood_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Covert_Cowl\" title=\"Covert Cowl\">Covert Cowl</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Helmet\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Helmet\">Dark Justiciar Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195406\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.061 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1586/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16338/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3052/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip